abstract: >-
  Cross-cutting LinkML data model for documenting data quality assessments,
  pedigree scores, diagnostics, remediation actions, provenance, and
  data-quality-derived uncertainty metadata in CE-RISE Digital Product Passport
  and Digital Material Passport records.
